2. Hourly Demand Pattern
For the selected weekdays, both Thursday and Saturday reached their highest average demand at 17:00. Thursday reached 6.01 and Saturday 5.99. The lowest demand occurred at 04:00, at 1.09 on Thursday and 1.51 on Saturday. The pattern shows a pronounced late-afternoon demand window and substantially lower overnight demand.

